<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/fn/VA22-Footnote5.5> a ipbes:Footnote ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:VA22 ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/VA22-5.2.1> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Systematic review of association between values of nature, nature´s contributions to people and good quality of life and futures in scenarios, visions and pathways (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4359655)." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Footnote5.5" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/fn/VA22-Footnote5.6> a ipbes:Footnote ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:VA22 ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/VA22-5.2.2.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "It should be noted that none of the futures works explicitly used the Life Frames of Nature’s Values or the Nature Futures Framework. These frameworks were applied only ex post as a lens to assess the futures works during expert (yet subjective) interpretation, conducted to keep coherence with other Chapters as well as other IPBES assessments and processes. Thus, these results need to be interpreted with caution." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Footnote5.6" .

