<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/fn/VA22-FootnoteSPM.12> a ipbes:Footnote ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:VA22 ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The present assessment uses the term “nature-based solutions” as defined by resolution 5/5 of the United Nations Environment Assembly of the United Nations Environment Programme: “actions to protect, conserve, restore, sustainably use and manage natural or modified terrestrial, freshwater, coastal and marine ecosystems, which address social, economic and environmental challenges effectively and adaptively, while simultaneously providing human well-being, ecosystem services and resilience and biodiversity benefits”." ;
    dcterms:identifier "FootnoteSPM.12" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/fn/VA22-FootnoteSPM.13> a ipbes:Footnote ;
