    ipbes:hasDescription "With regards to including diverse values, at one point in the assessment, the catch-all nature of the nature-based solutions concept raises a question mark, since nature-based solutions can vary considerably regarding how much they support biodiversity {6.3.1.1}." ;
    dcterms:identifier "FootnoteSPM.13" .

