        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/IFCNFI4X>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/KE9SV5RB>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/KW6P5ALC>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/L2D722G9>,
