        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/TX6SXMBW>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/WWCAGPIV>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2345372/items/Y4THK9I4>,
